OpenPI π0.5 for HandsOn

This repository is derived from OpenPI, originally released under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

HandsOn-specific modifications include:

- HandsOn LeRobot data configs and normalization assets.
- Single-arm and bimanual HandsOn policy input/output adapters.
- π0.5 action-dimension conversion utilities for 44-dimensional bimanual actions.
- HandsOn training, normalization, and tmux launch scripts.
- Documentation and installation workflow for HandsOn π0.5 training and serving.

Files and examples unrelated to HandsOn training may be omitted from this
distribution.

